WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.315 --> 00:00:04.246
(mysterious orchestral music)

00:00:06.597 --> 00:00:09.680
(quiet chatter)

00:00:11.786 --> 00:00:13.097
- [Man] Hey.
- [Woman] Hi.

00:00:13.097 --> 00:00:15.660
- Uh, I was actually just leaving.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.191
- Oh, it's fine.

00:00:18.191 --> 00:00:21.159
- Okay, all right, bye.

00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:23.738
(descending electrical surge)

00:00:23.738 --> 00:00:25.444
- [Voiceover] Well, here you are.

00:00:25.444 --> 00:00:27.441
Five minutes too long
on that conference call

00:00:27.441 --> 00:00:29.440
and now you have to sit alone at lunch.

00:00:30.564 --> 00:00:32.224
You could go back and eat at your desk,

00:00:32.224 --> 00:00:34.442
but somehow, that's even worse.

00:00:34.442 --> 00:00:36.764
And your usual lunch
partner's out with the boss.

00:00:36.764 --> 00:00:41.764
(uproarious laughter)

00:00:42.545 --> 00:00:44.530
Maybe if you stare at the
other table long enough,

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:46.883
they'll notice you.

00:00:46.883 --> 00:00:49.870
- Anna, come pull up a
chair, we can make room.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.574
No need to sit alone.
(women muttering)

00:00:53.574 --> 00:00:55.396
- No, uh, it's okay, there's no room.

00:00:55.396 --> 00:00:56.418
- No, we can make room.

00:00:56.418 --> 00:00:58.839
(women muttering)
- We can't.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.034
- [Voiceover] Well, that was humiliating.

00:01:02.034 --> 00:01:04.591
- Did you guys see Game
of Thrones last night?

00:01:04.591 --> 00:01:05.485
- Yes!

00:01:05.485 --> 00:01:07.227
- [Voiceover] You saw Game
of Thrones last night.

00:01:07.227 --> 00:01:10.048
You have something witty and
intelligent to say about it,

00:01:10.048 --> 00:01:12.393
but that conversation is not for you.

00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:15.211
You can't join from the
next table, that's pathetic.

00:01:16.131 --> 00:01:17.965
Time to pretend there's
something really interesting

00:01:17.965 --> 00:01:21.174
to look at on your phone,
nevermind you already checked

00:01:21.174 --> 00:01:23.631
Facebook, Instagram and
Twitter 20 times today,

00:01:23.631 --> 00:01:25.693
so there's nothing new.

00:01:25.693 --> 00:01:27.604
What is it about eating
alone that makes you

00:01:27.604 --> 00:01:28.845
feel like a loser?

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:31.582
No matter how old you get, no matter

00:01:31.582 --> 00:01:33.557
how confident you are in yourself,

00:01:33.557 --> 00:01:36.673
one empty table and it's like
high school all over again.

00:01:42.496 --> 00:01:47.227
Oh, thank God. Oh, (bleep) you, guy.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.420
- Is this seat taken?

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:50.569
- [Voiceover] You mean, is this seat taken

00:01:50.569 --> 00:01:51.831
by anyone more interesting?

00:01:51.831 --> 00:01:52.895
- All you.

00:01:53.815 --> 00:01:54.907
- [Voiceover] Now you
have to make small talk

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.680
with someone you'd
never choose to eat with

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:59.237
under normal circumstances.

00:01:59.237 --> 00:02:02.499
- [Man] So how's it going?
- [Woman] Good, good.

00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:04.372
- [Voiceover] You can't even
remember this guy's name.

00:02:04.372 --> 00:02:06.365
Ethan? Earl?

00:02:06.365 --> 00:02:08.118
You know he works in the
cubicle across from you,

00:02:08.118 --> 00:02:10.266
but beyond that, nothing.

00:02:13.886 --> 00:02:16.071
- So, did you watch Game
of Thrones last night?

00:02:16.071 --> 00:02:18.056
- Oh, no, I don't have HBO.

00:02:18.056 --> 00:02:19.716
- [Voiceover] Of course he doesn't.

00:02:19.716 --> 00:02:21.442
Heaven forbid he actually do something

00:02:21.442 --> 00:02:23.349
to contribute to the conversation.

00:02:23.349 --> 00:02:26.000
Now he's just gonna sit there
with his big stupid face

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.597
sucking on his big stupid sandwich.

00:02:28.597 --> 00:02:30.791
Well, nothing left to do
now besides pick up the pace

00:02:30.791 --> 00:02:32.638
and end this nightmare.

00:02:35.574 --> 00:02:37.664
- Good salad, huh?
- [Woman] Mm hmm.

00:02:37.664 --> 00:02:40.624
Well, back to the grind.
- [Man] Yeah.

00:02:41.471 --> 00:02:42.910
Go get 'em, tiger.

00:02:43.736 --> 00:02:45.489
- [Voiceover] Ah, thank God that's over.

00:02:45.489 --> 00:02:47.910
Eating alone is the absolute worst.

00:02:55.706 --> 00:02:57.993
- I like the part where
he's like, "And my axe."

00:02:57.993 --> 00:03:00.291
- Okay, that's Lord of the Rings.

00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:01.434
That's Lord of the--

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:05.913
(orchestra tuning note)

